note Independent definition-export result oracle. Golden SHA256 from external sha256sum.
note Exact spans computed from the fixed public source literals, never candidate output.
global data uchar 20000
global total ulong 1
global checks ulong 1
global bad ulong 1
global msg uchar 64
global mc ulong 1
text magic "OMDEFR01"
text hs0 "1a97b2dba35313ff25dcc7fc372ad9446a3cfafb025de3d041fcee13f3430625"
text hs1 "ba76433658e8220b1df92c7b5e31fa7aeb782525cd110a018b9e1f3f450c8ae8"
text hs2 "c532fce748267d120b6d6b4b561c9403860c3213482123389111170ef7509cda"
